:: Hospital Termination
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
The receptionist taps something into <<his>> computer and instructs you to take a seat in the waiting room.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>

<<harper_intro>>

"This is a permanent decision," <<he>> says. "Are you sure? If you are, the procedure can be performed today, though it'll cost you <<printmoney 20000>>."
<br><br>

<<if $money gte 20000>>
	<<procedureicon 'paternity'>><<link [[Terminate the pregnancy|Hospital Termination 2]]>>
		<<pass 2 hours>><<money -20000>>
	<</link>><br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">You can't afford it.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Hospital Foyer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hospital Termination 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>

<<upperstrip>>
<<lowerstrip>>
<<underlowerstrip>>
<<underupperstrip>>

Harper accepts the payment. "Please undress," <<he>> says as <<he>> stands to leave the room.
<br>

You remove your clothing and stand waiting, feeling more than a little exposed.
<<if playerChastity()>>You can't remove your $worn.genitals.name, you hope it won't be a problem.<</if>>
<<He>> soon returns, carrying a medical gown.
<br><br>

"Wear this," <<he>> instructs. You put the gown on. "Right, if you'd like to come with me, it's just a short walk away."
<br><br>

<<He>> leads you to another room, containing a small bed. "Please lie down. I'll put you under then move you to the theatre."
<br><br>

You lie down. <<He>> presses a mask against your face, and you feel your consciousness start to slip.
<br><br>

<<set _preg to getPlayerPregnancy()>>
<<set $terminationEarly to (_preg and pregnancyProgress(_preg) lt 0.34)>>
<<set _pregs to getActivePregnancies("pc")>>
<<set _ids to _pregs.map(p => p.pregnancyId)>>
<<run $pregnancies = $pregnancies.filter(r => !_ids.includes(r.pregnancyId))>>

<<if $sexStats.pregnancy isnot undefined>>
	<<set $sexStats.pregnancy.conceivedDate to null>>
<</if>>
<<if $sexStats.vagina.pregnancy isnot undefined>>
	<<set $sexStats.vagina.pregnancy.conceivedDate to null>>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Hospital Termination Done]]>><</link>>

:: Hospital Termination Done
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>

<<if $terminationEarly>>
	You awaken in the same room you passed out in. You don't feel much different, but you can tell something has changed.
<<else>>
	You awaken in the same room you passed out in. Your abdomen feels sore and empty, but a weight has been lifted from your chest.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Harper enters the room. "The procedure was a success," <<he>> says. "You can leave straight away. Be well." <<He>> leaves you to dress.
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Hospital Foyer]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
<br>